   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: scope precision (PR #1303). The operator's D3 decision covers **blocking** (Blacklist). Whitelist is a global list that works without an account (LOT-118), so it stays offered when logged out, as it is today. Only Blacklist is replaced by « Connectez-vous pour bloquer ». The issue text's « Blacklist / Whitelist stay hidden » is corrected to that. The reader's message « + » menu never held the list entries (`MessageMenuPolicy`), so it gets no hint: the reader's surface is the author menu.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
